## 📊 Dataset

This project utilizes the CirCor DigiScope Phonocardiogram Dataset for heart murmur classification research.

### Dataset Source

- CirCor DigiScope Dataset: https://physionet.org/content/circor-heart-sound/1.0.3/

### Dataset Description

The dataset contains:
- Normal heart sounds
- Abnormal heart sounds
- Murmur recordings
- Pediatric phonocardiogram (PCG) recordings
- Multiple recording conditions

### Citation

Please cite the original dataset source if used for research purposes.
